{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"撒迦利亞書","commonName":"撒迦利亞書","title":"撒迦利亞書","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"43ae9327f3a9401b8ec950d5d27f64f048bbd7ac8d6d42e14967d229e27fd011","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["「到那天，必為大衛家和耶路撒冷的居民開一個泉源，洗淨他們的罪惡和污穢。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「到那天，我必剷除地上偶像的名號，使它們被人遺忘；我必除去地上的假先知和污穢的靈。這是萬軍之耶和華說的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["若有人再說預言，他的親生父母必對他說，『你不可存活，因為你奉耶和華的名說謊。』他說預言的時候，他的親生父母必把他刺死。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["到那天，先知必因自己所講的異象而羞愧，不再穿著毛皮衣欺騙人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["他必說，『我不是先知，我是農夫，我從小便以種田為生。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["若有人問他，『你胸口上的傷是怎麼回事？",{"noteId":11},"』他必回答說，『是在我朋友家弄傷的。』」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["牧人被殺"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["萬軍之耶和華說：",{"text":"「刀劍啊，醒來吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要攻擊我的牧人和同伴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要擊打牧人，羊群將四散，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必出手攻擊小羊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地上三分之二的人必遭剷除、毀滅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只剩下三分之一的人存活。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使這三分之一的人受到火煉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像熬煉銀子一樣熬煉他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像試煉金子一樣試煉他們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必呼求我的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必回應他們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必說，『這是我的子民。』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必說，『耶和華是我們的上帝。』」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":11,"caller":"+","text":"異教的先知有用利器自割或自刺的習慣。","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":6}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}